WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Kamera ikusonyeza maso onse a mwana wamng'ono.

00:00:25.617 --> 00:00:45.617
Chithunzi chikuyandikira diso limodzi.

00:00:51.235 --> 00:01:11.235
Galasi lokulitsa la Arclight likugwiritsidwa ntchito kusonyeza kutsogolo kwa diso.

00:01:16.852 --> 00:01:36.852
Mwana wa diso wowunikiridwa ndi malo ake ozungulira zikuoneka mbali ina.
